  "goodToKnow": "Der Kaufpreis is the purchase price: der Kaufpreis eines Hauses, eines Autos. When buying property in Germany, Kaufnebenkosten add roughly 7 to 15 percent: Grunderwerbsteuer (land transfer tax, 3.5 to 6.5 percent depending on the state), notary and land registry fees, and often a broker (Makler). Der Preis also means prize: der Nobelpreis. Plural: die Kaufpreise."
